"{\n  \"AND\": {\n    \"left\": {\n      \"OR\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"AND\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"AND\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"OR\": {\n                        \"left\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"Have stable or unstable angina pectoris\"\n                        },\n                        \"right\": {\n                          \"OR\": {\n                            \"left\": {\n                              \"raw_text\": \"or atypical chest pain\"\n                            },\n                            \"right\": {\n                              \"raw_text\": \"or be asymptomatic with documented myocardial ischaemia.\"\n                            }\n                          }\n                        }\n                      }\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"OR\": {\n                        \"left\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"Have eligible for coronary revascularization\"\n                        },\n                        \"right\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"or have at least 2 lesions potentially amenable to stent implantation.\"\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"AND\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"AND\": {\n                        \"left\": {\n                          \"AND\": {\n                            \"left\": {\n                              \"AND\": {\n                                \"left\": {\n                                  \"OR\": {\n                                    \"left\": {\n                                      \"raw_text\": \"Have de novo native vessels\"\n                                    },\n                                  